<h1><%= case @event_type
when "project_created"
  "Your project was created"
when "project_accepted"
  "Your project was accepted"
when "project_rejected"
  "Your project needs attention"
else
  "Project update"
end %></h1>

<p><strong>Project:</strong> <%= @project.name %></p>
<p><strong>Client:</strong> <%= @project.client.name %></p>
<p><strong>Status:</strong> <%= @project.status.humanize %></p>

<% if @event_type == "project_created" %>
  <p>Your PM will review the project and move it forward.</p>
<% elsif @event_type == "project_accepted" %>
  <p>Your PM has accepted the project and work is in progress.</p>
<% elsif @event_type == "project_rejected" %>
  <p>Your PM needs changes before the project can move forward.</p>
<% end %>
